  layout: row 0 all bg; all 4 edges all bg [observed]; >=1 bg col gap between most components
  rule: each mover translates straight down until its bbox bottom touches grid bottom row; markers stay fixed; movers cleared from original positions
  constraint: dropped movers must not overlap each other or markers

generation_strategy:
